<title>MEXICO: Mexico vehicle production rises 5.5 pct Jan-July.</title>
<headline>Mexico vehicle production rises 5.5 pct Jan-July.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's automobile industry produced 745,558 vehicles in the first seven months of the year, 5.5 percent more than in the same period of 1996, the Mexican Automobile Industry Association said on Friday.</p>
<p>The industry produced 707,013 units in the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>Mexican vehicle exports fell 1.7 percent to 569,903 units in first seven months of 1997 from 579,668 during the year-ago period, the association said.</p>
</text>
